# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║  UND Dashboard — local development                                ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

# Bot API, server-side only (used by /api/bot proxy + server components)
API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1

# Same value as DASHBOARD_API_KEY in bot/.env — never exposed to the browser
DASHBOARD_API_KEY=

# NextAuth
NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=

# Discord OAuth2 app (same application as the bot)
# Redirect URI: http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback/discord
DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=
DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Admin user IDs (comma separated)
NEXT_PUBLIC_ADMIN_IDS=

NEXT_PUBLIC_BRAND_NAME="UND"
NEXT_PUBLIC_BRAND_NAME_WORD="UND"
